            "<p>Eukaryotic Cells</p>",
            "<p>Complex cells with nucleus (e.g., plants and animals)</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pem78mf",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. Structure of Cell"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qotn2bi",
      "content": "Main parts of a cell:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "m98awdx",
      "content": "• Cell membrane"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "9q9qvpp",
      "content": "• Cytoplasm"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "zflq0ef",
      "content": "• Nucleus"
    },
    {
      "id": "xixggrw",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. Cell Membrane"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0z1ems3",
      "content": "• Also called plasma membrane."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ju6rmm7",
      "content": "• Controls movement of substances into and out of the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ixxx83d",
      "content": "• It is selectively permeable."
    },
    {
      "type": "comparisonTable",
      "headers": [
        "Feature",
        "Plant Cell",
        "Animal Cell"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Cell Wall",
          "Present (composed of cellulose)",
          "Absent"
        ],
        [
          "Plastids / Chloroplasts",
          "Present (enables photosynthesis)",
          "Absent"
        ],
        [
          "Vacuole",
          "One large central vacuole",
          "Multiple small, temporary vacuoles"
        ],
        [
          "Centrosomes / Centrioles",
          "Absent in higher plants",
          "Present (helps in cell division)"
        ],
        [
          "Shape",
          "Fixed and rigid rectangular shape",
          "Flexible and irregular / round shape"
        ]
      ],
      "id": "h7avmg6"
    },
    {
      "id": "4wp2wxl",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. Cytoplasm"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "hjkzklb",
      "content": "• Cytoplasm is the jelly-like substance inside the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "q4q1v3c",
      "content": "• It contains organelles that perform different functions."
    },
    {
      "id": "9jtkh8n",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Nucleus"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "k710t5p",
      "content": "• Nucleus controls the activities of the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "abyflpv",
      "content": "• It contains genetic material (DNA)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "odyxmz7",
      "content": "• It regulates cell division."
    },
    {
      "id": "5zyyupf",
      "type": "heading",
